# Plans a collision-free motion to a target pose for the server's tip link,
# using inverse kinematics to find a goal configuration followed by free-space
# motion planning.
#
# The joint group to plan for. An empty string uses the server's default group.
string group_name

# The pose is interpreted in the frame given by its header.frame_id, which must
# be a frame known to the planning scene. An empty frame_id means the planning
# group's base link.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target_pose

# Optional scaling factors in (0, 1] applied to the joint limits when
# time-parameterizing the trajectory. Values <= 0 use the server's defaults.
float64 velocity_scaling
float64 acceleration_scaling

---

bool success
string message
trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory trajectory
